From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan Murray <ryan@aurorasilicon.org>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 04:01:34 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] media: apple: add fail-closed JPEG mem2mem scaffold

Add common V4L2 mem2mem/VB2 format and queue scaffolding, runtime PM,
and per-compatible exact HWREV admission. Both target allow-lists are
empty, so probe refuses every revision before video registration.

Read HWREV only with the power domain active. Implement no MMIO writes,
reset sequence, IRQ handler or DMA job; independently reject STREAMON
and scheduling. Retain device/context lifetime through last close.

Document the admission boundary and MIT-licensed public register-map
provenance. Add KUnit tests for empty target lists, invalid readbacks
and exact matching using synthetic revisions.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Ryan Murray <ryan@aurorasilicon.org>
(backported from commit 872e01eeed8b3120491a5cb803fdb09a4e0992d5)
[j604: context only: 1.607 has no ave/ in drivers/media/platform/apple, so the Kconfig source and Makefile obj-y lines for jpeg/ go after avd/ without the ave/ lines]
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
